#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "The public record of every Ditana package build — either every package is mutually consistent and the repository ships, or nothing ships."
msgstr "Il register public da mintga build da pachets da Ditana – u èn tut ils pachets coerents tranter els ed il repositori vegn furnì, u nagut na vegn furnì."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build status"
msgstr "Status dals builds"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid "import BuildDashboard from '~/components/BuildDashboard.astro';"
msgstr "import BuildDashboard from '~/components/BuildDashboard.astro';"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Ditana maintains its own pacman repository on top of Arch – 59 packages, "
"listed in full in every run that finished. A run that stopped lists what it "
"had reached. Every night a build host pulls each package's recipe, decides "
"what needs rebuilding, and builds it in a clean container. The rule that "
"governs what happens next is the only one that matters here:"
msgstr ""
"Ditana mantegna in agen repositori da pacman sin basa dad Arch – 59 pachets, "
"enumerads cumplettamain en mintga execuziun terminada. In’execuziun ch’è sa "
"fermada enumerescha quai ch’ella aveva cuntanschì. Mintga notg telechargia "
"in host da build il recept da mintga pachet, decida tge che sto vegnir "
"reconstruì e construescha il pachet en in container net. La regla che "
"determinescha tge che capita lura è l’unica che quinta qua:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "**If a single package cannot be built, or its sources cannot be verified, nothing is published.**\n"
msgstr "**Sch’in sulet pachet na po betg vegnir construì u sche sias funtaunas na pon betg vegnir verifitgadas, na vegn nagut publitgà.**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Not \"the rest ships and that one is retried tomorrow\". Nothing. The "
"repository you install from is either the complete, mutually consistent set "
"that came out of one run, or it is yesterday's complete, mutually consistent "
"set. A smaller repository can promise that; a large one, updating package by "
"package, cannot — which is why Ditana keeps its own small enough to vouch "
"for as one set."
msgstr ""
"Betg «il rest vegn furnì e quel pachet vegn empruvà danovamain damaun». "
"Nagut. Il repositori, ord il qual Vus installais, è u la collecziun "
"cumpletta e coerenta ch’è resultada d’ina execuziun, u la collecziun "
"cumpletta e coerenta dad ier. In repositori pli pitschen po empermetter "
"quai; in grond, che vegn actualisà pachet per pachet, na po betg – perquai "
"tegna Ditana ses agen repositori uschè pitschen, ch’el po vegnir garantì sco "
"ina suletta collecziun."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"A claim like that is worth exactly as much as its evidence, so the record "
"below is written by the pipeline itself, including the runs where nothing "
"shipped. That pipeline is [`ditana-build`](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-"
"build), and it is public: the review gate is [`bin/pkgbuild-review-gate`]"
"(https://github.com/acrion/ditana-build/blob/main/bin/pkgbuild-review-gate), "
"and the installation test is [`bin/test-install-in-qemu`](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-build/blob/main/bin/test-install-in-qemu)."
msgstr ""
"Ina tala pretensiun vala exactamain uschè bler sco sias cumprovas, perquai "
"vegn il register qua sutvart scrit da la pipeline sezza, inclusiv las "
"execuziuns, en las qualas nagut n’è vegnì furnì. Questa pipeline è [`ditana-"
"build`](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-build), ed ella è publica: la "
"controlla da revisiun è [`bin/pkgbuild-review-gate`](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-build/blob/main/bin/pkgbuild-review-gate), ed il test "
"d’installaziun è [`bin/test-install-in-qemu`](https://github.com/acrion/"
"ditana-build/blob/main/bin/test-install-in-qemu)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "<BuildDashboard />\n"
msgstr "<BuildDashboard />\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "How far a run got"
msgstr "Fin nua ch’ina execuziun è arrivada"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Every run passes through the same stages, and its `outcome` says which one "
"it reached. These are the four states, and the colours above:"
msgstr ""
"Mintga execuziun passa tras las medemas fasas, e ses `outcome` di tge fasa "
"ch’ella ha cuntanschì. Quai èn ils quatter stadis e las colurs survart:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `outcome` | What it means for you |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `released` | **This is what you install.** Every package built, every signature verified, and the whole set replaced the repository your system updates from. |\n"
"| `in-testing` | Built and signed, sitting in a separate testing repository while it is checked. Your system still installs the previous release. |\n"
"| `built` | The build host finished, but it holds no signing key — signing happens afterwards on another machine. Nothing has moved yet. |\n"
"| `held-back` | Something did not pass, so nothing shipped at all. The repository you install from is untouched and still consistent. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `outcome` | Tge che quai munta per Vus |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `released` | **Quai è quai che Vus installais.** Mintga pachet è construì, mintga signatura verifitgada, e l’entira collecziun ha remplazzà il repositori, ord il qual Voss sistem vegn actualisà. |\n"
"| `in-testing` | Construì e signà; la collecziun sa chatta en in repositori da test separà, durant ch’ella vegn controllada. Voss sistem installescha anc adina la versiun precedenta. |\n"
"| `built` | Il host da build ha terminà sia lavur, ma el n’ha nagina clav da signatura – la signatura ha lieu pli tard sin in’autra maschina. Anc nagut n’è vegnì spustà. |\n"
"| `held-back` | Insatge n’è betg reussì, perquai n’è insumma nagut vegnì furnì. Il repositori, ord il qual Vus installais, è intact ed anc adina coerent. |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Only `released` means the packages reached you. The other three are stages "
"on the way there, or a stop."
msgstr ""
"Mo `released` munta ch’ils pachets èn arrivads tar Vus. Ils auters trais èn "
"fasas sin la via fin là, u ina fermada."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "What happened to each package"
msgstr "Tge ch’è capità cun mintga pachet"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid "Within a run, every package gets one `status`:"
msgstr "Entaifer in’execuziun survegn mintga pachet in `status`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `status` | Meaning |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `current` | The recipe has not changed since the existing package was built, and for a `-git` package the upstream commit has not moved either. Nothing to do. |\n"
"| `rebuilt` | Sources were fetched and verified on the host, then the package was built in a fresh container. |\n"
"| `review-stopped` | The recipe changed in a way a human has to look at. The run ends here. |\n"
"| `build-failed` | The package did not compile, or produced no artefact. The run ends here. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `status` | Muntada |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `current` | Il recept n’è betg sa midà dapi ch’il pachet existent è vegnì construì, e per in pachet `-git` n’è er il commit d’origin betg sa midà. Nagut da far. |\n"
"| `rebuilt` | Las funtaunas èn vegnidas telechargiadas e verifitgadas sin il host, lura è il pachet vegnì construì en in container nov. |\n"
"| `review-stopped` | Il recept è sa midà en ina moda che ina persuna sto examinar. L’execuziun finescha qua. |\n"
"| `build-failed` | La cumpilaziun dal pachet n’è betg reussida, u il pachet n’ha producì nagin artefact. L’execuziun finescha qua. |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid "The last two are why a run ends as `held-back`: one package is enough."
msgstr ""
"Ils davos dus èn la raschun, pertge ch’ina execuziun finescha sco `held-"
"back`: in pachet basta."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why a run stops"
msgstr "Pertge ch’ina execuziun sa ferma"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Most of what Ditana rebuilds are third-party AUR recipes, packaged into a "
"repository its users trust through pacman's signature configuration. The AUR "
"is a supply chain, and it has been attacked as one: orphaned packages have "
"been adopted and given malicious commits, which is why the AUR disabled "
"adoption and pushes in August 2026."
msgstr ""
"La gronda part da quai che Ditana reconstruescha èn recepts da l’AUR da "
"terzas persunas, mess en in repositori, dal qual las persunas che "
"l’utiliseschan sa fidan tras la configuraziun da signaturas da pacman. L’AUR "
"è ina chadaina da furniziun, ed el è vegnì attatgà sco tala: pachets senza "
"persuna responsabla èn vegnids surpigliads ed han survegnì commits "
"nuschaivels, perquai ha l’AUR deactivà la surpigliada da pachets e la "
"transmissiun da commits l’avust 2026."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"So every `git pull` in the pipeline is classified before anything is built.  "
"Version bumps, comments, whitespace and checksums that accompany a version "
"change are waved through. A change to `source=`, to a `url=`, to a VCS "
"revision, to anything inside a function, to `install=`, to `provides=`, "
"`conflicts=`, `replaces=` or `validpgpkeys=`, a checksum that changes "
"without a version changing, a new dependency pacman does not know, a changed "
"or emptied `# Maintainer:` line — each of those stops the run. The recipe is "
"never sourced to do this: executing the file under suspicion is precisely "
"what has to be avoided, so the analysis is static, and it fails closed when "
"it is unsure."
msgstr ""
"Perquai vegn mintga `git pull` en la pipeline classifitgà, avant che insatge "
"vegn construì. Augments dal numer da versiun, commentaris, spazis e summas "
"da controlla che accumpognan ina midada da versiun vegnan laschads passar. "
"Ina midada da `source=`, d’in `url=`, d’ina revisiun VCS, da tut quai ch’è "
"entaifer ina funcziun, da `install=`, da `provides=`, `conflicts=`, "
"`replaces=` u `validpgpkeys=`, ina summa da controlla che sa mida senza che "
"la versiun sa midia, ina nova dependenza che pacman na conuscha betg, ina "
"lingia `# Maintainer:` midada u svidada – mintga singul cas ferma "
"l’execuziun. Il recept na vegn mai exequì per far quai: exequir la datoteca "
"suspectusa è precis quai che sto vegnir evità, perquai è l’analisa statica, "
"e cur ch’ella n’è betg segira, ferma ella l’execuziun."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Measured against the last twelve months of real package history, this stops "
"a run roughly **once every three and a half days**. That is not a defect to "
"be tuned away; it is the price of the all-or-nothing rule, paid in advance."
msgstr ""
"Sin basa da l’istorgia reala dals pachets dals ultims dudesch mais ferma "
"quai in’execuziun var **ina giada mintga trais dis e mez**. Quai n’è betg in "
"defect che stuess vegnir eliminà cun optimaziuns; quai è il pretsch da la "
"regla «tut u nagut», pajà ordavant."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Some of the recipes Ditana rebuilds have no upstream maintainer at all – "
"their `# Maintainer:` line is empty. That is why an emptied maintainer line "
"stops a run instead of being waved through: an orphaned recipe is the one "
"somebody can adopt."
msgstr ""
"Intgins dals recepts che Ditana reconstruescha n’han insumma nagina persuna "
"responsabla d’origin – lur lingia `# Maintainer:` è vida. Perquai vegn "
"in’execuziun fermada, sch’ina lingia da la persuna responsabla vegn svidada, "
"empè che quai vegnia laschà passar: in recept senza persuna responsabla è "
"quel che insatgi po surpigliar."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "What this does not check"
msgstr "Tge che quai na controllescha betg"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"The review covers packaging metadata, not upstream source code. When a "
"recipe builds from a git revision, that revision's contents are not reviewed "
"by anything in this pipeline. Ditana's advantage over an unreviewed rebuild "
"service is real but bounded, and stating the bound is part of the claim."
msgstr ""
"La revisiun cumpiglia las metadatas dals pachets, betg il code da funtauna "
"d’origin. Cur ch’in recept construescha a partir d’ina revisiun git, na vegn "
"il cuntegn da questa revisiun examinà da nagut en questa pipeline. "
"L’avantatg da Ditana envers in servetsch da reconstrucziun senza revisiun è "
"real, ma limità, e numnar questa limita fa part da la pretensiun."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "The installation test"
msgstr "Il test d’installaziun"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Building and signing a repository is not the same as being able to install "
"from it. Between the testing repository and the release there is one more "
"step: the build host installs that very repository into a virtual machine of "
"its own, unattended, driven by an answer file on a small config drive – the "
"same mechanism a hosting provider would use over PXE, which is why no "
"keystrokes are simulated."
msgstr ""
"Construir e signar in repositori n’è betg il medem sco pudair installar ord "
"el. Tranter il repositori da test e la publicaziun exista anc in pass: il "
"host da build installescha exact quest repositori en ina maschina virtuala "
"atgna, senza surveglianza, guidà d’ina datoteca da respostas sin in pitschen "
"disc da configuraziun – il medem mecanissem ch’in purschider da hosting "
"duvrass via PXE, perquai na vegnan naginas tastas simuladas."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Two things have to be true, and the record says which of them was reached."
msgstr ""
"Duas chaussas ston esser vairas, ed il register di tgenina da quellas è "
"vegnida cuntanschida."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| stage | What had happened |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `installing` | The medium is running. Nothing has been installed yet. |\n"
"| `installed` | The installer reached its final reboot. |\n"
"| `booted` | The installed system came up on its own and answered on port 22. This is a pass. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Fasa | Tge ch’era capità |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `installing` | Il medium è en funcziun. Anc nagut n’è vegnì installà. |\n"
"| `installed` | L’installatur ha cuntanschì ses ultim reaviar. |\n"
"| `booted` | Il sistem installà è s’avià sez ed ha respundì sin il port 22. Il test è reussì. |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"The distinction matters, because the two failures are different bugs. A run "
"that stops at `installing` produced a repository nobody can install from. "
"One that stops at `installed` produced a system that was written correctly "
"and does not come up, and that is the kind of defect no amount of building "
"catches."
msgstr ""
"La differenza è impurtanta, perquai ch’ils dus cas èn errurs differentas. "
"In’execuziun che sa ferma tar `installing` ha producì in repositori, ord il "
"qual nagina persuna na po installar. Ina che sa ferma tar `installed` ha "
"producì in sistem ch’è vegnì scrit correctamain, ma che na s’aviescha betg, "
"e quai è il tip da defect che nagina quantitad da builds na scuvra."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Arriving at `booted` signifies far more than the phrase implies. The "
"bootloader ran, the initramfs found and imported the ZFS pool, systemd got "
"to multi-user mode, the network became active, and a service started. "
"Nothing is injected into the guest to arrange any of these actions: `install-"
"openssh` is enabled by default, so a banner on port 22 is the installed "
"system’s own doing."
msgstr ""
"Cuntanscher `booted` munta bler dapli che la noziun lascha supponer. Il "
"bootloader è vegnì exequì, l’initramfs ha chattà ed importà il pool ZFS, "
"systemd è arrivà al modus multi-user, la rait è daventada activa ed in "
"servetsch è vegnì avià. Nagut na vegn injectà en il sistem giast per "
"arranschar ina da questas acziuns: `install-openssh` è activà sco standard, "
"uschia ch’ina bandiera sin il port 22 è l’ovra dal sistem installà sez."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"When the test fails, the record carries a picture of the guest’s screen at "
"the moment the harness gave up. The installation medium writes nothing to a "
"serial console once its bootloader has handed over, so everything the "
"installer draws is on that screen and nowhere else – an installer waiting at "
"a question is visible there and in no log at all."
msgstr ""
"Cur ch’il test na reussescha betg, cuntegna il register in maletg dal visur "
"dal sistem giast en il mument che l’ambient da test ha dà si. Il medium "
"d’installaziun na scriva nagut sin ina consola seriala, uschespert che ses "
"bootloader ha surdà la controlla, perquai è tut quai che l’installatur mussa "
"sin quest visur e nagliur auter – in installatur che spetga sin ina dumonda "
"è visibel là ed en nagin protocol."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"A failed test releases nothing. The packages stay in the testing repository, "
"and the repository you install from is untouched."
msgstr ""
"In test betg reussì na publitgescha nagut. Ils pachets restan en il "
"repositori da test, ed il repositori, ord il qual Vus installais, resta "
"intact."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where the signing key is"
msgstr "Nua che la clav da signatura sa chatta"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid "The machine that builds holds a signing subkey, not the primary key."
msgstr ""
"La maschina che construescha ha ina clav secundara da signatura, betg la "
"clav principala."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"It builds, signs with that subkey, uploads to the testing repository, "
"installs that repository into a virtual machine, and releases to production "
"only if the installation worked. Keeping the key off the build host is "
"something the pipeline still supports, and it was how Ditana worked until "
"August 2026; it was given up because a release gated on a test installation "
"has to happen on the machine that has just built, and the split put a second "
"machine and a manual step in between. What the subkey buys instead: it can "
"be revoked and replaced on its own, it cannot certify further keys, and the "
"fingerprint users verify against never changes."
msgstr ""
"Ella construescha, signa cun questa clav secundara, chargia si en il "
"repositori da test, installescha quest repositori en ina maschina virtuala e "
"publitgescha en la producziun mo sche l’installaziun ha funcziunà. Tegnair "
"la clav davent dal host da build è insatge che la pipeline sustegna anc "
"adina, ed uschia ha Ditana lavurà fin l’avust 2026; ins ha renunzià a quai, "
"perquai ch’ina publicaziun che dependa d’ina installaziun da test sto avair "
"lieu sin la maschina ch’ha gist construì, e la separaziun metteva ina "
"segunda maschina ed in pass manual tranteren. Quai che la clav secundara "
"porta empè: ella po vegnir revocada e remplazzada separadamain, ella na po "
"betg certifitgar ulteriuras clavs, e l’impronta, cun la quala i vegn "
"verifitgà, na sa mida mai."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"What this protects is the key, not the packages: the signing machine signs "
"what the build host produced, without reviewing it. What it prevents is the "
"machine that runs foreign build scripts being able to have arbitrary data "
"signed at any time."
msgstr ""
"Quai che vegn protegì è la clav, betg ils pachets: la maschina che signa, "
"signa quai ch’il host da build ha producì, senza examinar quai. Quai che "
"vegn impedì è che la maschina che exequescha scripts da build esters possia "
"laschar signar datas arbitraras en mintga mument."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verifying this yourself"
msgstr "Verifitgar quai persunalmain"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid "The record is plain JSON and is not generated by this website:"
msgstr "Il register è JSON simpel e na vegn betg generà da questa website:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"[`/build-history/index.json`](/build-history/index.json) — the rolling index "
"of the most recent runs."
msgstr ""
"[`/build-history/index.json`](/build-history/index.json) – l’index actualisà "
"cuntinuadamain da las execuziuns las pli recentas."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"`/build-history/<timestamp>.json` – one file per run: `outcome`, `message`, "
"`counts`, a `test-install` object where a run was tested, and a `packages` "
"array whose entries carry `name`, `status`, `seconds`, any `detail`, and the "
"paths of that package's logs."
msgstr ""
"`/build-history/<timestamp>.json` – ina datoteca per execuziun: `outcome`, "
"`message`, `counts`, in object `test-install`, sche l’execuziun è vegnida "
"testada, ed ina matriza `packages` cun endataziuns che cuntegnan `name`, "
"`status`, `seconds`, eventualmain `detail`, ed ils percurs dals protocols da "
"quest pachet."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"The `test-install` object carries `result`, the `stage` the guest reached, "
"the `iso` and `answer-file` it was driven with, and, where the installation "
"failed, a `screenshot` path under `/build-history/logs/<timestamp>/test-"
"install/` holding the guest's screen at the moment the harness gave up."
msgstr ""
"L’object `test-install` cuntegna `result`, il `stage` ch’il sistem giast ha "
"cuntanschì, l’`iso` e l’`answer-file` cun ils quals el è vegnì guidà, e, "
"sche l’installaziun n’è betg reussida, in percurs `screenshot` sut `/build-"
"history/logs/<timestamp>/test-install/` cun il maletg dal visur dal sistem "
"giast en il mument che l’ambient da test ha dà si."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"`/build-history/logs/<timestamp>/<package>/` — what `makepkg` logged while "
"building that package, split by stage (`prepare`, `build`, `check`, "
"`package`). Every rebuilt package in a run is linked from its row above, and "
"a package whose build failed is logged too — that is the one worth reading."
msgstr ""
"`/build-history/logs/<timestamp>/<package>/` – quai che `makepkg` ha "
"protocollà durant la construcziun da quest pachet, repartì tenor fasa "
"(`prepare`, `build`, `check`, `package`). Mintga pachet reconstruì d’ina "
"execuziun è collià da sia lingia survart, ed er in pachet, dal qual il build "
"n’è betg reussì, vegn protocollà – quel vala la paina da leger."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Server names, addresses, paths and the build account's login name are "
"removed from the records and from the logs before they are written. Nothing "
"else is filtered; the failure text you see is the failure text the pipeline "
"saw."
msgstr ""
"Nums da servers, adressas, percurs ed il num d’utilisader da l’account da "
"build vegnan allontanads dals registers e dals protocols, avant ch’els "
"vegnan scrits. Nagut auter na vegn filtrà; il text d’errur che Vus vesais è "
"il text d’errur che la pipeline ha vis."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "Under which licences"
msgstr "Sut tge licenzas"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/builds.mdx
msgid ""
"Every package here is built from a publicly available recipe that names its "
"upstream source. [Licensing](/licensing/) says where to find both, and "
"covers the one case where the licence itself is contested: the ZFS packages, "
"of which Ditana distributes the sources and the userspace tools but never a "
"compiled kernel module."
msgstr ""
"Mintga pachet qua vegn construì a partir d’in recept publicamain disponibel "
"che numna sia funtauna d’origin. [Licenzas](/licensing/) di nua che Vus "
"chattais omadus e tracta l’unic cas, en il qual la licenza sezza è "
"contestada: ils pachets ZFS, dals quals Ditana distribuescha las funtaunas "
"ed ils utensils userspace, ma mai in modul dal kernel cumpilà."
